        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-15",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Right foot and first MTP examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Mild soft tissue swelling and localized erythema at the right first MTP. No deformity, skin breaks, ulcers, nail change, or obvious tophi. Tender over the dorsum and medial aspect of the first MTP, with mild warmth compared with the left. No fluctuance or plantar tenderness. Dorsiflexion slightly reduced due to pain; otherwise range of motion preserved, with pain mainly at extremes."
      }
    },
